@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-62 - View Revenue Stats

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Analytics UI" as FE
control "AnalyticsController" as API
control "AnalyticsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills, shoesDetail" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-62
FE -> API: GET /analytics/overview
API -> Service: Execute View Revenue Stats
Service -> DB: Read/write bills, shoesDetail
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Biểu đồ doanh thu hiển thị

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang ở dashboard
Post: Biểu đồ doanh thu hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin xem revenue section trên dashboard
2. System gọi API GET /analytics/overview; date range endpoint recommended
3. System trả về: revenue by day/week/month
4. Hiển thị line chart / bar chart
end note
@enduml
